# Share HTTP

Docs: [share-cold-load-nfr05.md](../../docs/share-cold-load-nfr05.md), [share-abuse-posture.md](../../docs/share-abuse-posture.md).

## Security

- Loopback bind by default (`127.0.0.1:8765`)
- 32-byte random tokens; SHA-256 at rest only
- No raw GPS in share HTML templates
- 429 responses use fixed body — no token oracle

## HTTP tests

- **Single source of truth:** `internal/share/http_test.go`
- Add route/contract scenarios there only

## NFR gates

- NFR-05: `TestNFR05_ShareColdLoadMedian` — median ≤ 3s, `DisableKeepAlives: true`
- NFR-06: rate limiter in `ratelimit.go` — document posture changes in `docs/share-abuse-posture.md`

## Templates

- Embedded assets in `web/share/` via `go:embed`
- Prefer semantic HTML for WCAG Level A
